# NOTICE — Failure Zoo Provenance Policy (D19)

The failure zoo is a materialized view over the audit DAG (D9). Every specimen
distributed with this repository MUST carry provenance in its metadata:

- source repository URL and commit hash
- source repository license
- seed bug type tag (logic / off-by-one / rename / race / config)

Specimens derived from repositories whose license does not permit
redistribution of code fragments (e.g. GPL-family for verbatim code) are
excluded from the distributed corpus or distilled to synthetic equivalents:
hashes, diffs, and test names only — never verbatim code.

This policy is a v0.1 release blocker (D19). The curating tooling lives in the
zoo module (T9) and is exercised by CI on every release.